{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265xYONrjyEZ1793768153.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段短片，有市民途經屯門藍地交匯處時，發現一名大叔竟將迴旋處內圈的草地範圍當作個人高爾夫球練習場。從車Cam及現場影片可見，大叔頭戴帽子、身穿藍色無袖上衣與短褲，在草坪上預備了大量高爾夫球，隨後全神貫注地調整姿勢並進行揮桿動作。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-04-12h51m53s638.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QScZcpYNkA1793768176.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>影片上載至網絡後引來大批網民討論，不少人質疑在道路交匯處打球會對行駛車輛構成潛在風險，紛紛留言表示疑慮：「打到啲車點算？」、「會唔會執番啲波？」。 </p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-04-12h51m51s596.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mE1jWcbkBu1793768190.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>不過，有部分街坊及經常行經該處的網民指出，該名大叔早已是該處的「常客」，透露：「佢打咗好多年，唔明點解要喺呢度打，又嘈又多塵！」。更有網民補充表示，大叔的出現甚至早於附近地盤動工前：「呢條友喺呢度打咗好多年，未有地盤已經喺度打」，指「有時都見到佢」在該處揮桿。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:46:10.267697+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:30.043030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T05:38:51.062547+00:00","content_hash":"bbc47fb2c53573efe365a3ae94db24a8f1a2bdb59af76fe3c145cec79313c548","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:46:10.267697+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}